# Bees Motion deploy workflow

After completing requested website changes in this repo (`meklads/beesmotion`):

1. **Commit** with a clear message (HEREDOC) when there are relevant changes.
2. **Push to GitHub** on `main` with `git push origin main` — do this by default, without waiting for a separate “push” ask.
3. Prefer also running `npm run deploy` (Cloudflare Pages) so production stays in sync.

Do not leave finished work only local. If push fails, fix and retry or tell the user why.
